          "html": "<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-2-0\">\n<h3>完整原文 · 第2段</h3>\n<p>Outside directors are supposed to serve as helpful, yet less biased, advisers on a firm’s board. Having made their wealth and their reputations elsewhere, they presumably have enough independence to disagree with the chief executive’s proposals. If the sky, and the share price, is falling, outside directors should be able to give advice based on having weathered their own crises.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-2-1\">\n<h3>意群划分 · 第2段</h3>\n<p>Outside directors are supposed to serve as helpful, / yet less biased, / advisers on a firm’s board. / Having made their wealth and their reputations elsewhere, / they presumably have enough independence to disagree with the chief executive’s proposals. / If the sky, / and the share price, / is falling, / outside directors should be able to give advice based on having weathered their own crises.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-2-2\">\n<h3>意群翻译 · 第2段</h3>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8;color:#2563eb;font-weight:500\">外部董事应该提供帮助 / 但不那么有偏见 / 公司董事会顾问<br>在其他地方创造了财富和声誉 / 他们大概有足够的独立性来不同意首席执行官的提议<br>如果天空 / 和股价 / 正在下降 / 外部董事应该能够根据自身经历的危机提出建议</p>\n</section>",
