          "html": "<section class=\"revealPart\">\n<h4>句子精析 (8/8)</h4>\n<p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:1.15em;color:#1e293b;line-height:1.7\"><strong>原句：</strong>Often they “trade up”, leaving riskier, smaller firms for larger and more stable firms.</p>\n<p><strong>意群断句：</strong><code>Often they “trade up”, / leaving riskier, / smaller firms for larger and more stable firms.</code></p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0\"><strong>【意群翻译】：</strong><span style=\"color:#2563eb;font-weight:500;font-size:1.02em\">Often they “trade up / 离开风险更大 / 较小的公司适合较大且更稳定的公司</span></p>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0;background:#f8fafc;border-left:4px solid #0f766e;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\">\n  <p style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0f766e;margin-bottom:4px\">【句法拆解与逻辑剖析】</p>\n  <ul style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px;padding:0;line-height:1.7;color:#334155\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px\"><b>分词短语作状语/定语</b>：现在分词短语 <code>leaving riskier...</code> 作伴随/结果状语或后置修饰，增强语义表现力。</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top:8px\"><strong>【满分参考汉译】</strong><span style=\"color:#0f766e;font-weight:600;font-size:1.05em\">他们通常会“升级”，将风险较高、规模较小的公司留给规模更大、更稳定的公司。</span></p>\n</section>",
