          "html": "<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-1-0\">\n<h3>完整原文 · 第1段</h3>\n<p>We tend to think of the decades immediately following World War II as a time of prosperity and growth, with soldiers returning home by the millions, going off to college on the G.I. Bill and lining up at the marriage bureaus.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-1-1\">\n<h3>意群划分 · 第1段</h3>\n<p>We tend to think of the decades immediately following World War II as a time of prosperity and growth, / with soldiers returning home by the millions, / going off to college on the G.I. / Bill and lining up at the marriage bureaus.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-1-2\">\n<h3>意群翻译 · 第1段</h3>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8;color:#2563eb;font-weight:500\">我们倾向于认为第二次世界大战后的几十年是繁荣和增长的时期 / 数以百万计的士兵返回家园 / 乘坐退伍军人证上大学<br>比尔在婚姻局排队</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-1-3\">\n<h3>标准译文 · 第1段</h3>\n<p>我们倾向于将第二次世界大战后的几十年视为繁荣和发展的时期，数以百万计的士兵返回家园，靠着退伍军人权利去上大学。比尔在婚姻局排队。</p>\n</section>",
