          "html": "<section class=\"revealPart\">\n<h4>句子精析 (2/3)</h4>\n<p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:1.15em;color:#1e293b;line-height:1.7\"><strong>原句：</strong>The phrase “less is more” was actually first popularized by a German, the architect Ludwig Mies van der Rohe, who like other people associated with the Bauhaus, a school of design, emigrated to the United States before World War II and took up posts at American architecture schools.</p>\n<p><strong>意群断句：</strong><code>The phrase “less is more” was actually first popularized by a German, / the architect Ludwig Mies van der Rohe, / / who like other people associated with the Bauhaus, / a school of design, / emigrated to the United States / before World War II and took up posts at American architecture schools.</code></p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0\"><strong>【意群翻译】：</strong><span style=\"color:#2563eb;font-weight:500;font-size:1.02em\">“少即是多”这句话实际上是由德国人首先流行起来的。 / 建筑师路德维希·密斯·凡德罗 / 喜欢与包豪斯相关的其他人 / 设计学院 / 移民到美国 / 二战前在美国建筑学校任职</span></p>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0;background:#f8fafc;border-left:4px solid #0f766e;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\">\n  <p style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0f766e;margin-bottom:4px\">【句法拆解与逻辑剖析】</p>\n  <ul style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px;padding:0;line-height:1.7;color:#334155\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px\"><b>非限制性定语从句</b>：<code>,who like other people associated with the Bauhaus...</code> 引导非限制性定语从句，对前文先行词进行补充说明与信息拓展。</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px\"><b>同位语/插入语</b>：<code>a school of design</code> 充当同位语/插入语，紧随其后对前置名词提供身份补充或同等指代。</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px\"><b>介词短语修饰</b>：<code>with the Bauhaus...</code> 充当状语或定语，补充方式、伴随或背景条件。</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top:8px\"><strong>【满分参考汉译】</strong><span style=\"color:#0f766e;font-weight:600;font-size:1.05em\">“少即是多”这句话实际上是由德国建筑师路德维希·密斯·凡德罗（Ludwig Mies van der Rohe）首先流行起来的，他和其他与包豪斯设计学院有联系的人一样，在二战前移居美国，并在美国建筑学校任职。</span></p>\n</section>",
