          "html": "<section class=\"revealPart\">\n<h4>句子精析 (5/6)</h4>\n<p style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:1.15em;color:#1e293b;line-height:1.7\"><strong>原句：</strong>The apartments in the elegant towers Mies built on Chicago’s Lake Shore Drive, for example, were smaller—two-bedroom units under 1,000 square feet—than those in their older neighbors along the city’s Gold Coast.</p>\n<p><strong>意群断句：</strong><code>The apartments in the elegant towers Mies built on Chicago’s Lake Shore Drive, / for example, / were smaller—two-bedroom units under 1,000 square feet—than those in their older neighbors along the city’s Gold Coast.</code></p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0\"><strong>【意群翻译】：</strong><span style=\"color:#2563eb;font-weight:500;font-size:1.02em\">位于芝加哥湖岸大道上的密斯优雅塔楼中的公寓 / 例如 / 比黄金海岸的老邻居更小，两居室单位面积不到 1,000 平方英尺</span></p>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0;background:#f8fafc;border-left:4px solid #0f766e;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\">\n  <p style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0f766e;margin-bottom:4px\">【句法拆解与逻辑剖析】</p>\n  <ul style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px;padding:0;line-height:1.7;color:#334155\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:5px\"><b>主干结构剖析</b>：全句为主谓宾/主系表基础陈述结构，核心主干明确，意群衔接紧密自然。</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top:8px\"><strong>【满分参考汉译】</strong><span style=\"color:#0f766e;font-weight:600;font-size:1.05em\">例如，密斯在芝加哥湖滨大道上建造的优雅塔楼中的公寓比位于城市黄金海岸的老邻居中的公寓要小，两居室单元面积不到 1,000 平方英尺。</span></p>\n</section>",
