          "html": "<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-6-0\">\n<h3>完整原文 · 第6段</h3>\n<p>A “southern” camp headed by France wants something different: “European economic government” within an inner core of euro-zone members. Translated, that means politicians intervening in monetary policy and a system of redistribution from richer to poorer members, via cheaper borrowing for governments through common Eurobonds or complete fiscal transfers. Finally, figures close to the French government have murmured, euro-zone members should agree to some fiscal and social harmonisation: e.g., curbing competition in corporate- tax rates or labour costs.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-6-1\">\n<h3>意群划分 · 第6段</h3>\n<p>A “southern” camp headed by France wants something different: / “European economic government” within an inner core of euro-zone members. / Translated, / / that means politicians intervening in monetary policy and a system of redistribution from richer to poorer members, / via cheaper borrowing for governments through common Eurobonds or complete fiscal transfers. / Finally, / figures close to the French government have murmured, / euro-zone members should agree to some fiscal and social harmonisation: / e.g., / curbing competition in corporate- tax rates or labour costs.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-6-2\">\n<h3>意群翻译 · 第6段</h3>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8;color:#2563eb;font-weight:500\">以法国为首的“南方”阵营想要一些不同的东西 / European economic government” within an inner core of euro-zone members<br>已翻译 / 这意味着政治家干预货币政策和从较富裕成员到较贫穷成员的再分配制度 / 通过共同欧洲债券或完整的财政转移支付为政府提供更便宜的借款<br>最后 / 接近法国政府的人士抱怨道 / 欧元区成员国应就一定程度的财政和社会协调达成一致 / 例如 / 抑制企业税率或劳动力成本方面的竞争</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-6-3\">\n<h3>标准译文 · 第6段</h3>\n<p>以法国为首的“南方”阵营想要不同的东西：在欧元区成员国的核心内建立“欧洲经济政府”。换句话说，这意味着政治家通过共同欧洲债券或完整的财政转移支付为政府提供更便宜的借款，从而干预货币政策和从较富裕成员到较贫穷成员的再分配体系。最后，接近法国政府的人士抱怨称，欧元区成员国应该同意一些财政和社会协调措施：例如，遏制企业税率或劳动力成本方面的竞争。</p>\n</section>",
