          "html": "<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-7-0\">\n<h3>完整原文 · 第7段</h3>\n<p>It is too soon to write off the EU. It remains the world’s largest trading block. At its best, the European project is remarkably liberal: built around a single market of 27 rich and poor countries, its internal borders are far more open to goods, capital and labour than any comparable trading area. It is an ambitious attempt to blunt the sharpest edges of globalisation, and make capitalism benign.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-7-1\">\n<h3>意群划分 · 第7段</h3>\n<p>It is too soon to write off the EU. / It remains the world’s largest trading block. / At its best, / the European project is remarkably liberal: / built around a single market of 27 rich and poor countries, / its internal borders are far more open to goods, / capital and labour than any comparable trading area. / It is an ambitious attempt to blunt the sharpest edges of globalisation, / and make capitalism benign.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-7-2\">\n<h3>意群翻译 · 第7段</h3>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8;color:#2563eb;font-weight:500\">现在取消欧盟还为时过早<br>它仍然是世界上最大的贸易区<br>处于最佳状态 / 欧洲项目非常自由 / 围绕 27 个富国和穷国的单一市场建立 / 其内部边界对商品更加开放 / 资本和劳动力超过任何可比贸易区域<br>这是一次削弱全球化最锋利边缘的雄心勃勃的尝试 / 并使资本主义变得良性</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-7-3\">\n<h3>标准译文 · 第7段</h3>\n<p>现在就取消欧盟还为时过早。它仍然是世界上最大的贸易区。在最好的情况下，欧洲项目是非常自由的：围绕27个富国和穷国的单一市场建立，其内部边界对商品、资本和劳动力的开放程度远高于任何类似的贸易区域。这是一次雄心勃勃的尝试，目的是削弱全球化最锋利的边缘，使资本主义变得良性。</p>\n</section>",
